<doc id="62458" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=62458" title="Fédération Internationale de Football Association">
Fédération Internationale de Football Association

Fédération Internationale de Football Association (FIFA) utawa Federasi Internasional Persatuan Bal-balan iku bebadan panata prakara &lt;a href="bal-balan"&gt;bal-balan&lt;/a&gt; mancanagara. FIFA duwé markas ing &lt;a href="Z%C3%BCrich"&gt;Zürich&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt;.
FIFA diadegaké ing &lt;a href="Paris"&gt;Paris&lt;/a&gt; tanggal &lt;a href="21%20M%C3%A8i"&gt;21 Mèi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1904"&gt;1904&lt;/a&gt; lan ngrayakaké dina dadiné angka 100 ing taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;. Sasi April 2004, FIFA mbiwara yèn bakal ngraup kauntungan $144 yuta saka $1,64 miliar pametu ing taun 2003 lan 2006.
FIFA uga promosi bal-balan, ngatur transfer juru main antar tim, mènèhi gelar &lt;a href="Pemain%20Paling%20Apik%20Donya%20FIFA"&gt;Pemain paling apik donya FIFA&lt;/a&gt;, lan macak pratélan &lt;a href="Peringkat%20Donya%20FIFA"&gt;Peringkat Donya FIFA&lt;/a&gt; saben sasi.
Pranatan bal-balan dikukuhaké déning &lt;a href="IFAB"&gt;IFAB&lt;/a&gt; (International Football Association Board), dumadi saka papat wakil saka FIFA lan siji-siji wakil saka &lt;a href="Asosiasi%20Bal-balan%20Inggris"&gt;Asosiasi Bal-balan Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Asosiasi%20Bal-balan%20Sekotlan"&gt;Asosiasi Bal-balan Sekotlan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Asosiasi%20Bal-balan%20Wales"&gt;Asosiasi Bal-balan Wales&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Asosiasi%20Bal-balan%20Irlandia"&gt;Asosiasi Bal-balan Irlandia&lt;/a&gt;.
