Pančevo (&lt;a href="basa%20Serbia"&gt;basa Serbia&lt;/a&gt;: Панчево, &lt;a href="basa%20Honggari"&gt;basa Honggari&lt;/a&gt;: Pancsova, &lt;a href="basa%20Turki"&gt;basa Turki&lt;/a&gt;: Pançova, &lt;a href="basa%20Jerman"&gt;basa Jerman&lt;/a&gt;: Pantschowa/Banstadt, &lt;a href="basa%20Rumania"&gt;basa Rumania&lt;/a&gt;: Panciova, &lt;a href="basa%20Slowak"&gt;basa Slowak&lt;/a&gt;: Pánčevo) iku &lt;a href="kutha"&gt;kutha&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="kuthamadya"&gt;kuthamadya&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Serbia"&gt;Serbia&lt;/a&gt; wétan-lor, watara 15 &lt;a href="kilom%C3%A8ter"&gt;kilomèter&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Beograd"&gt;Beograd&lt;/a&gt;. Wewengkon kuthamadya kang ndunungi 127.162 jiwa (&lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;) lan wewengkon kuthané 77.087 jiwa (2002). Wewengkon kuthamadya nyakup laladan kang jembaré 759&amp;nbsp;km²
Kutha iki minangka pusat administratif &lt;a href="Distrik%20Banat%20Kidul"&gt;Distrik Banat Kidul&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="pelabuhan"&gt;pelabuhan&lt;/a&gt; kutha iki minangka salah siji kang paling wigati ing sadawaning &lt;a href="Kali%20Timi%C5%9F"&gt;Kali Timiş&lt;/a&gt; kang mili cedhak kutha iki.
Watara 80% kang ndunungi Pančevo ya iku &lt;a href="wong%20Serbia"&gt;ètnis Serbia&lt;/a&gt;.
