<doc id="62774" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=62774" title="Tim nasional bal-balan Amérika Sarékat">
Tim nasional bal-balan Amérika Sarékat

Tim nasional bal-balan &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; wiwit pungkasan dekade 1980-an, wis dadi kakuatan anyar ing bal-balan donya. Miturut pratélan Peringkat Donya &lt;a href="F%C3%A9d%C3%A9ration%20Internationale%20de%20Football%20Association"&gt;Fédération Internationale de Football Association&lt;/a&gt; sing diwetokaké Mèi 2006, AS wis ana ing peringkat kalima.
Sadurungé, bal-balan dianggep ulah raga kelas loro sing kalah populer karo &lt;a href="American%20football"&gt;American football&lt;/a&gt;. AS tau mèlu sajeroning telung &lt;a href="Piala%20Donya"&gt;Piala Donya&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Piala%20Donya%20FIFA%201930"&gt;1930&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Piala%20Donya%20FIFA%201934"&gt;1934&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Piala%20Donya%20FIFA%201950"&gt;1950&lt;/a&gt;) nanging wektu iku diiloni déning para juru main imigran.
Wiwit &lt;a href="Piala%20Donya%20FIFA%201990"&gt;1990&lt;/a&gt;, AS ora tau absèn mèlu Piala Donya kanthi prèstasi paling apik lumebu perempatfinal ing Piala Donya &lt;a href="Piala%20Donya%20FIFA%202002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;. Tim iki kasingkir sawisé kalah saka &lt;a href="Tim%20nasional%20bal-balan%20Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; sing sabanjuré lolos menyang babak final.
<h2>Piala Donya 2006</h2>
Piala Donya 2006.
Pelatih &lt;a href="Bruce%20Arena"&gt;Bruce Arena&lt;/a&gt; isih ngango sapérangan skuad 2002. Sajeroning skuad 2006 iki ana jeneng-jeneng kaya &lt;a href="Kasey%20Keller"&gt;Kasey Keller&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Eddie%20Lewis"&gt;Eddie Lewis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Landon%20Donovan"&gt;Landon Donovan&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="DaMarcus%20Beasley"&gt;DaMarcus Beasley&lt;/a&gt;, sarta veteran &lt;a href="Claudio%20Reyna"&gt;Claudio Reyna&lt;/a&gt; sing wis mèlu wiwit Piala Donya &lt;a href="Piala%20Donya%20FIFA%201994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt; ing AS.
