<doc id="62922" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=62922" title="Tim nasional bal-balan Slowak">
Tim nasional bal-balan Slowak

Tim nasional bal-balan Slowak iku tim sing makili &lt;a href="Slowak"&gt;Slowak&lt;/a&gt; sajeroning kajuwaraan internasional lan dikontrol déning Asosiasi Bal-balan Slowak.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Slowak naté main 16 tetandhingan antara taun &lt;a href="1939"&gt;1939&lt;/a&gt; nganti &lt;a href="1944"&gt;1944&lt;/a&gt;, nanging banjur bubar sawisé &lt;a href="Perang%20Donya%20II"&gt;Perang Donya II&lt;/a&gt;. Sadurungé tim Ceko lan Slowak main bebarengan sajeroning &lt;a href="Tim%20nasional%20bal-balan%20Cekoslowakia"&gt;Cekoslowakia&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé &lt;a href="Cekoslowakia"&gt;Cekoslowakia&lt;/a&gt; pecah ing taun &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;, tim nasional uga ngalami owah-owahan, main kanggo sapisanan &lt;a href="14%20Oktober"&gt;14 Oktober&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;, nalika menang 1-0 nglawan &lt;a href="Tim%20nasional%20bal-balan%20Litowen"&gt;Litowen&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Vilnius"&gt;Vilnius&lt;/a&gt;.
Slowak nggayuh play-off kualifikasi &lt;a href="Piala%20Donya%20FIFA%202006"&gt;Piala Donya FIFA 2006&lt;/a&gt;, nalika tim iki kalah saka &lt;a href="Tim%20nasional%20bal-balan%20Spanyol"&gt;Spanyol&lt;/a&gt;.

</doc>
<doc id="62923" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=62923" title="Tim nasional bal-balan Selandia Anyar">
Tim nasional bal-balan Selandia Anyar

Tim nasional bal-balan Niu Selan, kanthi jejuluk All Whites, iku tim nasional bal-balan &lt;a href="Niu%20Selan"&gt;Niu Selan&lt;/a&gt; lan dikontrol déning &lt;a href="Bal-balan%20Niu%20Selan"&gt;Bal-balan Niu Selan&lt;/a&gt;. 
Niu Selan racaké tarung karo &lt;a href="Tim%20nasional%20bal-balan%20Ostrali"&gt;Ostrali&lt;/a&gt; sajeroning &lt;a href="Konfederasi%20Bal-balan%20Oseania"&gt;Konfederasi Bal-balan Oseania&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging bab iki ora bakal kadadéan manèh amarga &lt;a href="Tim%20nasional%20bal-balan%20Ostrali"&gt;Ostrali&lt;/a&gt; saiki main ing &lt;a href="AFC"&gt;Zona Asia&lt;/a&gt;. Niu Selan wis menangaké &lt;a href="Piala%20Oseania"&gt;Piala Oseania&lt;/a&gt; kaping telu, ing &lt;a href="Piala%20Oseania%201973"&gt;1973&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Piala%20Oseania%201998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Piala%20Oseania%202002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Rékor Piala Donya</h2>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Piala%20Donya%20FIFA%201930"&gt;1930&lt;/a&gt; hingga &lt;a href="Piala%20Donya%20FIFA%201966"&gt;1966&lt;/a&gt; - Ora ikut</li>
